{"3158820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kalanoro", "steam_appid": 3158820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Help make our developers happy, wishlist Kalanoro :)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/749e689eb0dffb76194e9455fc312a5b.avif?t=1786356226\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras_big/749e689eb0dffb76194e9455fc312a5b.avif?t=1786356226 width=1560 height=494 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/928fd210eb05e8a1b202b0e72ced4f66.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/928fd210eb05e8a1b202b0e72ced4f66.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/928fd210eb05e8a1b202b0e72ced4f66.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/f4684be6816e8abf687a7253d5a0dd02.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1088 height=78 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/b873ae63514e8e0083da6d931c4a5542.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/b873ae63514e8e0083da6d931c4a5542.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/b873ae63514e8e0083da6d931c4a5542.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat Raneny’s minions in fast-paced combat, using hair-based powers and improvised weapons (slippers included) to fight epic and groovy boss battles and free the island! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/b6a8c2e7e2e219c3585a4a1aaf700507.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1088 height=78 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/123c4e99619fa7c9fb807ab107116422.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/123c4e99619fa7c9fb807ab107116422.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/123c4e99619fa7c9fb807ab107116422.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assemble a band of eccentric lemur artists, manage your tour bus through mini-games, and build your band’s popularity among locals to perform on bigger stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/083585301ad33d7979ea47c6f6458b02.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1088 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/59e0be61d8ea6237853ed3cf71fc1575.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/59e0be61d8ea6237853ed3cf71fc1575.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/59e0be61d8ea6237853ed3cf71fc1575.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A world inspired by Madagascar’s folklore. Once a paradise, it now<strong> </strong>suffers under the witch Raneny’s ruthless rule. Having grown tired of exploiting its people, she decided to host a huge concert with the island’s most famous band. You’re sent on a mission to fight back by rallying legendary musicians to your cause! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/fe6a6ec65f6f85cc4d8916697abee686.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1088 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/a79b6955120f981cbe63be584b540b0b.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/a79b6955120f981cbe63be584b540b0b.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/a79b6955120f981cbe63be584b540b0b.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dash through diverse biomes across Lemuria, save and befriend funky locals to form your crew, and jump over industrial platforming traps to become Lemuria’s number one band and finally face Raneny! </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/928fd210eb05e8a1b202b0e72ced4f66.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/928fd210eb05e8a1b202b0e72ced4f66.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/928fd210eb05e8a1b202b0e72ced4f66.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/f4684be6816e8abf687a7253d5a0dd02.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1088 height=78 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/b873ae63514e8e0083da6d931c4a5542.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/b873ae63514e8e0083da6d931c4a5542.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/b873ae63514e8e0083da6d931c4a5542.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat Raneny’s minions in fast-paced combat, using hair-based powers and improvised weapons (slippers included) to fight epic and groovy boss battles and free the island! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/b6a8c2e7e2e219c3585a4a1aaf700507.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1088 height=78 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/123c4e99619fa7c9fb807ab107116422.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/123c4e99619fa7c9fb807ab107116422.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/123c4e99619fa7c9fb807ab107116422.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assemble a band of eccentric lemur artists, manage your tour bus through mini-games, and build your band’s popularity among locals to perform on bigger stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/083585301ad33d7979ea47c6f6458b02.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1088 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/59e0be61d8ea6237853ed3cf71fc1575.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/59e0be61d8ea6237853ed3cf71fc1575.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/59e0be61d8ea6237853ed3cf71fc1575.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A world inspired by Madagascar’s folklore. Once a paradise, it now<strong> </strong>suffers under the witch Raneny’s ruthless rule. Having grown tired of exploiting its people, she decided to host a huge concert with the island’s most famous band. You’re sent on a mission to fight back by rallying legendary musicians to your cause! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/fe6a6ec65f6f85cc4d8916697abee686.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1088 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/a79b6955120f981cbe63be584b540b0b.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/a79b6955120f981cbe63be584b540b0b.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/a79b6955120f981cbe63be584b540b0b.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dash through diverse biomes across Lemuria, save and befriend funky locals to form your crew, and jump over industrial platforming traps to become Lemuria’s number one band and finally face Raneny! </p>", "short_description": "Kalanoro is an action-adventure platformer where you build a band of lemur artists. Explore Lemuria, recruit lemur musicians, grow your band and use platforming and combat to fight the witch Raneny, one song at a time.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japan